<contentList>
	<content contentuid="he9f32d68g0b86g493eg880dgad8d06bc29d7" version="1">Marchio infernale</content>
	<content contentuid="hc7f0d3dcg8f9ag4b8fg983egf778ffb2db10" version="1">Quando infliggi&lt;b&gt;[2]&lt;/b&gt; a un bersaglio sotto &lt;LSTag Type="Status" Tooltip="BURNING_HELLFIRE"&gt;fuoco infernale&lt;/LSTag&gt;, subisce anche &lt;LSTag Type="Status" Tooltip="MAG_Ring43_Status_1"&gt;fuoco diabolico&lt;/LSTag&gt; per &lt;b&gt;[1]&lt;/b&gt; turni.</content>
	<content contentuid="h54e8320ag9e57g4053gaca3g5cf956562df2" version="1">Quando infliggi&lt;b&gt;[2]&lt;/b&gt; a un bersaglio sotto &lt;LSTag Type="Status" Tooltip="BURNING_HELLFIRE"&gt;fuoco infernale&lt;/LSTag&gt;, subisce anche &lt;LSTag Type="Status" Tooltip="MAG_Ring43_4_Status_1"&gt;fuoco diabolico&lt;/LSTag&gt; per &lt;b&gt;[1]&lt;/b&gt; turni.</content>
	<content contentuid="h6498381bg068ag4b87g91a8g4bca525ca940" version="1">Forgia infernale</content>
	<content contentuid="h31b4c4e6g39e6g49a1ga9a8ge0d6fd14f69f" version="1">Forgiato nel metallo infernale, questo anello permette di lanciare &lt;LSTag Type="Spell" Tooltip="MAG_Ring43_4_scorchingVolley"&gt;Salva incandescente&lt;/LSTag&gt; e riduce di &lt;b&gt;[2]&lt;/b&gt; tutti i&lt;b&gt;[1]&lt;/b&gt; subiti.</content>
	<content contentuid="hea2c2781geea0g4fd9gae16g7cdcb44ce7b7" version="1">Fuoco diabolico</content>
	<content contentuid="hc48051c4g9c9fg4df8g9cbcg760563dc63d0" version="1">La creatura influenzata diventa &lt;LSTag Tooltip="Vulnerable"&gt;vulnerabile&lt;/LSTag&gt; a&lt;b&gt;[1]&lt;/b&gt;.</content>
	<content contentuid="hc6b64c20g9931g4259g9b6bg07aab2222a6a" version="1">Salva incandescente</content>
